  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Property includes dedicated Rosemary Beach® community Beach Access via 9 Private Beach Walkovers. Beach chair service available for an additional cost through RBPOA Beach Service. Complimentary access to Rosemary Beach® Fitness and complimentary court time at Rosemary Beach® Racquet Club also included.​​​​​​​<br><br>Comfort truly meets chic in this luxury Benecki home, steps away from the Rosemary Beach® Fitness Center and Racquet Club. Complete with three floors of ultimate luxury, soothing neutral tones on the Venetian plaster walls greet you upon entry. Eyes avert upward, showcasing a grand staircase adjacent to the first master suite. The master is home to a grand king bed with a spa-style private bathroom, which features double vanities and walk-in shower of Carrera marble.<br><br>Make your way through the foyer and into the ultra-modern kitchen. The kitchen overflows to a grand scullery with a second dishwasher, additional sink, and plenty of storage. Enjoy ample space for meal preparation as your guests are seated around the kitchen island, featuring lush, woven bar seating. With a large open floor plan, and a six burner cooktop (with a griddle), oven warmer, Subzero refrigerator, and top-of-the-line stone countertops. As you breeze through the open living room, gaze upwards to the hand-crafted wooden beams that line the ceiling, paired with a rustic farmhouse coffee table, synced perfectly with modern decor. Mixed with contemporary oil-rubbed bronze light fixtures and a sleek 65-inch flat screen TV with surround sound, Atlanta designer, Melanie Turner, left no detail unnoticed. The grand room also features a fireplace, perfect for curling up with a good book and a glass of vino, as well as a lush L-shaped sectional and two cushioned ottomans. Make your way through the fully retractable, sliding paneled glass doors and out onto your private porch to enjoy a private pool, complete with a three-step entry. Around the corner, enjoy an ultra-modern gas grill and icemaker, perfect for hosting outdoor gatherings. <br><br>Back inside, head upstairs and into the first guest bedroom, fit for a king. Stop and admire the view from the adjacent reading nook, perfect for lounging for two. Steps away an alternate guest room, which hosts soft pink tones, with mirrored bedside tables, fit for a queen. Each guest bedroom's en suite bath with single vanities and marble shower and tub combinations. At the end of the second floor, a full laundry room awaits, with an HE washer and dryer, with lots of premium counter space for folding. <br><br>Ascend to the third floor, where a billiard table and a massive grey suede couch await, with enough seating for twelve. Off the billiard room is a grand in-home theatre, featuring an 80-inch, high definition TV with lounging chairs, perfect for a relaxing night in. <br><br>Next, make your way to fabulous bunkroom that boasts four custom built-in bunks, complete with private TV stations for the bottom beds and muted walls. A large bathroom is shared between the in-home theatre, billiard room and the bunkroom.<br><br>But that's not all. The main house is shared with a stunningly quaint carriage house, which shares the glorious courtyard and pool area. Featuring fresh pine-wooded floors, a table for four greets you upon entry, leading into a seating area with a lush couch and chair that complements the room perfectly. The living area is complete with a 40-inch plasma TV and modern, neutral décor. The carriage house master features a queen bed, paired with matching nightstands. The luscious bathroom invites you to relax with a tiled shower and single vanity. <br><br>Ideally located next to Rosemary Beach Fitness Center, Sky Pool. Racquet Club, and an easy five minute walk to the beach, and a two minute walk to Town Center. <br><br>7 NIGHT MINIMUM, SATURDAY-SATURDAY YEAR ROUND<br>Pool can be heated for an additional fee.<br><br>Features<br>First Floor Master Bedroom<br>8 Complimentary Adult Bikes/ $100.00 Concierge Credit<br>Cozy Reading Nook<br>Billiard Room<br>Theater Room<br>Scullery Off the Kitchen<br>Steps to Fitness & Tennis<br>Heated, Private Pool (additional pool heating fee)<br>Carriage House included in rental<br>Bedding: 2 Kings | 2 Queens | 8 Twins<br>Opulent Great Room<br>Amenities<br>Pool<br>Fireplace<br>High-Speed Internet<br>Free Adult Bikes<br>Luxury Collection<br>Parking<br>Garage Parking for 2 Vehicles + 2 On-street parking passes (4 vehicles)",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Austen Cottage & Carriage House - Ultra Comfort Meets Modern Chic"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
